      "event_seq": 1546,
      "event_sha256": "b9d70b9712f6db548bb8a2b8d2b3f5fae447135754ec7910b56b14a1e4240c8a",
      "original_answer_timestamp": null,
      "review_date": "2026-09-14",
      "answer_sha256": "f4c32fa3d7574fc069eed7fcd0a2fee88a2d8bd40e4a92f158884cc51887469e",
      "answer_utf8_bytes": 797,
      "explicitly_replaces_prior_answer": false,
      "replaces_reference": null,
      "answer_text": "I want it to be... Em, not specifically. I want N.H. to be able to realize... how I want it to be. I want N.H to be able to know me so well... that in later usage... after it really know-like, understood who I am... I want it to be able to... do everything on its own... without me needing to... to tell it... because it is supposed to be like the perfect AI much for me. But I want it to take my lead. If I do something in the world, it needs to be able to see everything I do, and decide... what to do with it... And if I correct it, it needs to be able to... take it... less points, more points... and learn by the time... Like agents do of AI. And I could also be able to... tell it... what to do. It should never be able to... decide over me, because it is the tool and I am the human person."
    },
