      "answer_text": "The exact backtracking and return order between spaces depends on the situation. Ness may choose the route and order directly, or ask N.H to choose and carry them out. N.H has broad default permission to manage the return path, but it must follow the current request from Ness, and an explicit refusal from Ness always overrides."
